# corpus/NOTICES

Every program in `corpus/` is third party work.
It is here because its licence permits redistribution.
This file names the origin, the licence, and the upstream commit of each one.

A program that does not have such a licence does not go in this directory.
The test harness fetches those at run time instead, from a manifest of pinned
hashes, and their bytes are never committed.

